stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Intended: settings enable
  Intended --> Materialized: policy allow + fetch/cache
  Materialized --> Parsed: manifest/components valid
  Parsed --> Active: runtime refresh
  Active --> DisabledIntent: settings disable
  DisabledIntent --> Inactive: new runtime snapshot excludes
  Inactive --> Orphaned: old cache marked
  Orphaned --> Removed: retention cleanup
